      "writtenOn": "2021-02-12T09:37:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we avoid adding a method that returns a NetworkInfo? NetworkInfo has been deprecated since Q and the legacy APIs that use it are extremely error-prone; a recent example is b/172870110. There\u0027s also b/179501234 to wean the JobScheduler off NetworkInfo-based APIs entirely.\n\nI don\u0027t think JS actually does much of anything with the NetworkInfo it gets; the only thing it does is called isConnected() which can be misleading (and in fact that\u0027s one of the two causes of b/172870110 : isConnected returns false when the network is suspended).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1363,
        "startChar": 11,
